{"id": "37098", "title": "只吻小醉鬼", "author": "蜜果子", "category": "文学名著", "count": 21, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/37/37098.htm", "intro": "她曾经相信过男人，代价就是在自己床上看见别的女人，\r\n所以她决心改变，成为独立自主的新女性，\r\n这一变，她才惊觉自己的才华有多好，\r\n甚至连知名珠宝公司都对她这名不见经传的设计师有兴趣，\r\n可她万万没想到，对方代表居然是曾和她有过一夜的男人！\r\n她想逃，他却用再次肯定她的设计来留住她的脚步，\r\n甚至力捧她成为主力设计师，\r\n她不是傻子，不会看不出他眼中的喜欢，\r\n面对他的温柔体贴攻势，她终于愿意再相信一次爱情，\r\n谁知道，命运居然又开了她一次玩笑……", "base": "files/article/html/37/37098", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2910233.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(1)", "file": "2910234.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(2)", "file": "2910235.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(1)", "file": "2910236.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(2)", "file": "2910237.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(1)", "file": "2910238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(2)", "file": "2910239.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(1)", "file": "2910240.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(2)", "file": "2910241.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章(1)", "file": "2910242.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第5章(2)", "file": "2910243.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章(1)", "file": "2910244.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章(2)", "file": "2910245.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(1)", "file": "2910246.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(2)", "file": "2910247.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(1)", "file": "2910248.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(2)", "file": "2910249.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(1)", "file": "2910250.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(2)", "file": "2910251.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(1)", "file": "2910252.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(2)", "file": "2910253.html", "available": true}]}